WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.040
Just being at your side,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:16.160
Gentles my hearts to the point of disbelief

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:25.570
I thought I heard the sound of your footsteps behind me,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:35.720
I turned my head repeatedly, wishing you would appear...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.740
...and then there you were

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:50.990
The beginning of a new love

00:00:51.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Is unknowingly, the beginning of our invisible love story

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:15.360
Hence, I shall never leave your side

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.540
I pledge to love you and only you

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.320
<i>Shuji... today, I wiped out another city.</i>

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:57.850
No! I don't want to die!

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.550
Don't kill me!

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.280
I know I've killed a lot of people...

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.320
but I want to live!

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:11.220
Because, I've finally found...

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:13.890
someone to say "I love you" to!

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:19.030
There are so many things I want us to do together!

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:28.440
Chise, you aren't going to die.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:34.810
It doesn't matter what weapon they try to use,

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.680
no one can kill you, Chise.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.000
No one...

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.300
can stop you.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.120
You won't die.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.820
Aren't you glad, Chise?

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.740
I have a wife.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.340
She's always complaining that she's lonely.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.210
She needs a lot of attention.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.650
Even so, I love this woman.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:19.650
But I'm going to die in this war, and probably soon.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.560
I don't want to die...

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.060
I want to hold her.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.470
It's good to be alive.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.540
It's good to have a man you love.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:49.890
<i>Shuji,</i>

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:53.890
<i>I'm going to try to remember...</i>

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:58.460
<i>what all those cities</i> <i>I destroyed looked like.</i>

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:04.140
<i>The look of the cities,</i> <i>where all those people lived...</i>

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:08.780
<i>It'll be sad, but I want to try</i> <i>my best to remember.</i>

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:16.750
<i>Because, no one will ever forgive me</i> <i>for what I've done.</i>

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.720
<i>But I have someone to love...</i>

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:25.330
In order to let you keep dreaming, I shall protect the night.
<i>But I have someone to love...</i>

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:25.600
In order to let you keep dreaming, I shall protect the night.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.850
<i>so I want to live.</i>

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:27.940
In order to let you keep dreaming, I shall protect the night.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:32.190
<i>No matter what, I want to be allowed...</i>

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.630
<i>these two things.</i>

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:51.840
'Morning.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:58.800
"Liar"

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.870
So, there are five verbal aspects,

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:07.860
infinitive, continuous, participial, subjunctive, and imperative.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:28.320
Chise!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:30.150
Ow.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.290
Chise!

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:36.080
What are you doing? Wake up, will ya?

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:38.990
Huh?

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.160
Aw, jeez...

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:41.830
Sorry.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.630
Earthquake...

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:48.960
I think...

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:53.380
We should evacuate soon...

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:02.420
Now look, we do evacuation drill when the bell rings.

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.740
Or is my class that boring?

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.500
Teacher! Gotta take a leak!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.180
Chise!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.430
What are ya doing?!

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.420
Shuji, wait!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.290
Shuji, slow down!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.660
Bombers? Missiles? What is it?!

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:50.730
What's coming?!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.700
Thank you, Shuji.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:59.310
Sorry, but please get out of here.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.310
Dummy!

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:03.250
We're a couple! We leave together!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.350
Chise...

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:09.050
Sorry, but I'm dangerous now.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:13.720
Sorry, there's a big earthquake coming.

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:18.930
I'm a weapon, but I'm not complete yet.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:25.280
If I mistake it for an attack, I don't know what I'll do.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:32.510
Chise!

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.270
Don't look!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:36.280
Sorry...

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.280
Shuji, run...

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:43.820
Hurry up and run!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:46.860
Sorry! Don't look at me!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.670
<i>Why?! Why am I running away?!</i>

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:58.930
Damn!

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:02.480
And I'm supposed to be her boyfriend!

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:12.810
Chise!

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:27.930
Chise!

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:59.650
Huh, oh... Shuji... 'morning...

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.670
Is this all that happened?

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:12.150
The way I am now, I could have easily wiped out the school.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:15.850
I'm glad.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:24.950
You look like you've seen something really tragic.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:27.420
Poor thing.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.090
"Poor thing"?

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:40.000
Huh?

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:45.070
Shuji, what's happened? Where am I?

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.140
What about the earthquake?

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.080
Chise, I'm sorry.

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:55.050
Chise, I'm so sorry!

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:59.920
Shuji, what's wrong? You're hurting me!

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.460
Sorry!

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:03.760
Shuji...

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.030
Sorry,

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.370
Sorry...

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:12.070
I'm sorry!

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.230
Sorry...

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:33.420
It's OK.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.600
That's strange.

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.760
Maybe I broke something just now.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.330
<i>I thought Chise was...</i>

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:49.310
You saw that, right? I misfired.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.980
I was afraid I might go off.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:56.950
I've gained more control of myself,

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:00.550
so all that happened was a small bang.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:02.040
<i>Stop it...</i>

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:05.590
But it looks like something in me got broken instead.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:08.020
<i>Don't say it!</i>

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:09.160
Sorry.

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:10.870
I told you not to say it!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.510
Let's go back, Chise.

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:26.180
Sorry.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.700
I'm going with them.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:35.550
Chise...

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.250
<i>Sorry, Shuji.</i>

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:42.200
<i>I'll die if it keeps going like this.</i>

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:45.460
<i>As a weapon, I need maintenance.</i>

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.930
<i>As a human, I need medicine.</i>

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:52.270
<i>I can't survive anymore without them.</i>

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:53.540
Chise...

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.350
Chise!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.150
I'll see you tomorrow at school!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.100
Chise...

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:06.680
I'm OK. I'll get stronger!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.390
Chise, why?!

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:10.320
Why aren't you angry?!

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.590
Don't you realize who did this to you?!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:14.870
It was that old geezer!

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:18.500
He's the only one of them who survived!

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.060
Uh, shall we be going?

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.820
Don't you care?!

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:29.080
Chise! I have more to say to you!

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:30.870
I can't take this!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.510
Come to Observation Hill tonight!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.750
I'll be waiting!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:39.520
Hold on, Akemi!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.520
Let go of me!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.650
They're still inside! Chise and Shuji...

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:45.150
Shuji... Shuji!

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:45.980
Shuji!

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.860
Shuji, you're OK!

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:52.030
Where's Chise?

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:55.440
She's hurt a little, so they're taking her to the hospital.

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:57.430
By helicopter?

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:00.170
I see. I'm glad.

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.710
Where were you two?!

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.210
If you go off by yourselves,

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.550
it causes trouble for the whole group!

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.640
What's that look for?

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:15.720
<i>You don't know a damned thing!</i> <i>That Chise's protecting you!</i>

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:18.820
I'm sorry.

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:23.520
Is everyone here?!

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.140
Sorry.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:46.820
Shuji!

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.500
Shuji!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.160
Ow!

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:06.440
Sorry, I didn't mean it.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.820
I just got carried away.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.840
Everyone was worried about you.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:15.320
Me, Akemi, everyone.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:23.110
Shuji, I'm going to quit school and enlist.

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.100
Huh?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.790
There's a girl I want to protect.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:33.860
I've always wanted

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:38.970
to take care of her no matter what.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:44.170
Really? Is it someone I know?

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:46.980
Akemi.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.710
I want to protect Akemi!

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:52.340
Is it OK with you, Shuji?

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.820
Dummy! What are you asking me for?

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:01.130
Heh, you're right...

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:05.760
<i>I envied Atsushi.</i>

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:10.900
<i>My whole world was changing...</i>

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.340
<i>leaving me behind.</i>

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:15.210
Shuji!

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:23.640
Shuji... you aren't hurt, are you?

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:25.060
Ms. Fuyumi!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.180
I'm glad...

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.820
Emergency

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.480
Ryohei, good job.

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:02.610
I hope you didn't feel pain.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.530
Your girlfriend?

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.360
You're from Aomori, right?

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:12.690
Lucky. That's near Chise's town.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.270
It's still peaceful there.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:18.560
You keep it.

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:24.740
Nakamura...

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.280
Lieutenant Tetsu...

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:38.290
You think... Chise didn't come... because she had a date?

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:43.830
I wish I hadn't broken up with my girl...

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:50.730
I still love her... you know?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:54.500
What are you talking about, Nakamura?

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:57.980
It hurts...

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.910
If I have to die, I wish Chise had done it.

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:06.720
Idiot! How much do you expect of her?!

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:08.060
But...

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:10.620
She's just a high school girl.

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:15.890
But... it hurts so much...

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:22.590
Why do we have to die like this?

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.100
When Chise kills, they don't feel anything!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.440
It hurts bad...

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.310
Sorry about this...

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:39.950
The whole world's going to suffer more...

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.520
Everyone, I'm sorry...

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:48.720
Why am I saying this?

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:52.030
I sound just like Chise.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:57.900
Everyone... I'm sorry.

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:04.880
I'm fading... fading...

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.310
Mom...

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:19.630
<i>Sorry, Shuji. I'm late.</i>

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:21.780
<i>Wait for me, Shuji.</i>

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.760
<i>This time, I'll be there.</i>

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:40.730
Reporting, Commander!

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.620
The entire Kanto theater is...

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:45.450
Such recklessness.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.380
Huh?

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.890
I've linked to the satellite and confirmed.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:54.660
You didn't follow my instructions?

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.460
We couldn't.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:00.260
So then, they're all...

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.280
We had no choice.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:07.390
Commander! The situation is deteriorating rapidly!

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:11.180
My boyfriend's waiting on Observation Hill. I have to go now.

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:17.820
Commander! Reconnaissance reports your friend is not there.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:18.990
I have to go.

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:20.710
Commander!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.240
Shuji'll be there!

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:23.660
Halt!

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:30.290
Fool. If you shoot me, there won't be a city here anymore.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:32.780
You won't shoot me...

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:37.500
In a moment, I won't be myself anymore,

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:41.510
and when I come to, I'll be all alone.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:46.040
But... what about our people, Commander?!

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.080
What's the difference?

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:50.820
If I go, more people will die.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:56.440
It'll be the enemy I'm supposed to kill,

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:02.660
instead of the people I know and love.

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:04.440
That's all.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:11.100
What's the difference to me?

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.370
It's the same.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.070
It just hurts more, that's all.

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:18.870
Please let me go!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:22.610
My boyfriend's waiting!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:24.880
Just this once!

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:31.820
Please! Don't make me kill people in this town!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.100
Why didn't you come, Shuji?

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:48.240
Shuji...

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:53.600
Where are you now? What are you doing?

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.440
What's... what's this?

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.110
A report?

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.080
Am I monitoring Shuji?

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.290
No! I don't want to!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:05.660
Stop it!

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:08.390
I don't want to know!

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:10.020
No...

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:19.500
Ms. Fuyumi...

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:29.980
Hurry up and get here, Shuji.

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.220
You said you wanted to talk.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:37.420
There's so much I want to say to you, too.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:39.850
You know, I'm scared.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.960
I'm going to die.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:49.500
Without love, what will happen to me, Shuji?

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:58.010
I can't taste anything.

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:09.790
<i>It's so warm...</i>

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:19.420
<i>We stayed like that 'til dawn.</i>

00:22:20.660 --> 00:22:24.470
<i>Then Chise slowly opened</i> <i>her mouth and said...</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:27.970
Liar.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.420
A rift opened up upon my heart

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:49.990
And I went through the night sleepless, sighing constantly

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:59.340
Before I realize, it's turned to morning

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.660
I want to hear your voice

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:13.250
I want to feel your warmth

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:19.460
Thoughts of you well up within me

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.310
And my tears begin to overflow

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:36.570
Goodbye my beloved, I am still unable to forget about you

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:46.740
Having all of this end with just a single word of goodbye

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:51.570
Fills me with sorrow

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:03.370
What's wrong with me?

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:05.350
I'm supposed to be Chise's boyfriend, and yet...

00:24:05.390 --> 00:24:07.320
Even though I love Chise, I still...

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:09.840
Chise, I'm sorry...

00:24:10.320 --> 00:24:15.010
SAIKANO, Episode 6: "Classmates"
